# Assets are not committed, their descriptors are. Git sees the directory structure and every
# _archive.toml; everything else stays local and comes from a provenance root or a build.
*
!*/
!_archive.toml
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Patches are the exception: an authored fix is not reproducible from any provenance root, so it is
# the one kind of asset that has to be committed.
!patches/**
